    ('zn-bathroom-kit-3pcs-gun-grey-2', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0331/0321/6685/files/Capture_800x.jpg?v=1759234866', null),
    ('zn-drywall-paper-tape-2-1-16-x500', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0331/0321/6685/files/Drywall-Paper-Tape-7_800x.webp?v=1758745491', 'Drywall joint reinforcement Inside and outside corner finishing Crack and hole patching.'),
    ('zn-dust-free-hand-sander', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0331/0321/6685/files/0032043_dust-free-drywall-hand-sander-wvac-hook-up-kit_800x.jpg?v=1758744973', 'Building trade professionals, who build our homes and countries demand quality, innovation, and SATISFACTION from the tools they use every day. Goldblatt tool company has been helping meet that demand for over 130 years. Goldblatt tool company designs, manufactures, and distributes high quality trade tools in the masonry, concrete, drywall, tile, and paint tool categories to a worldwide market. This culture of quality and innovation with a firm commitment to research and development helps goldblatt consistently meet the specific needs of the professionals and consumers that we Serve throughout the world. Designed for use with Standard sanding screens. Adjustable vent allows for variable vacuum force. 360 Degree pivoting elbow for ease of use on vertical surfaces. Low-profile knobs stay out of the way. Lightweight with soft grip ergonomic handle includes 6 ft hose, coupler and adapter for compatibility with most shop-type vacuums.'),
    ('zn-10-in-cnr-bright-white-frp', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0331/0321/6685/files/download_1_800x.png?v=1758743505', 'PVC Inside Corner Moulding is essential for creating a finished, professional look where FRP panels are joined at an inside corner. They provide a sanitary seam sealing open corners where dirt, stains and bacteria can collect. This curved corner design makes for easy cleaning. 8ft PVC Moulding, resists mould, mildew, bacteria and stains Required for CFIA accepted installation Suggested installations includes use of silicone caulk.'),
    ('zn-8-in-cnr-bright-white-frp', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0331/0321/6685/files/download_1_800x.png?v=1758743505', 'PVC Inside Corner Moulding is essential for creating a finished, professional look where FRP panels are joined at an inside corner. They provide a sanitary seam sealing open corners where dirt, stains and bacteria can collect. This curved corner design makes for easy cleaning. 8ft PVC Moulding, resists mould, mildew, bacteria and stains Required for CFIA accepted installation Suggested installations includes use of silicone caulk.'),
    ('zn-tyvek-homewrap-gen-9-x100', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0331/0321/6685/files/DUPONTTYVEK3X100HOMEWRAP-min_550x550_9a018315-79d7-4a7b-8757-6d5435965079_800x.webp?v=1758743328', 'DuPont Tyvek HomeWrap delivers the optimum balance of properties for superior performance against the elements. Tyvek HomeWrap helps prevent outside water from entering the walls and helps to seal the home to keep outside air where it belongs. DuPont Tyvek HomeWrap helps reduce homeowner energy bills because homes stay cool in the summer and warm in the winter and dry all year round. Tyvek® HomeWrap® helps protect a home against damaging wind and rain that can penetrate through the exterior cladding into the wall. The unique non-woven fibre structure of DuPont Tyvek® HomeWrap® stops air movement through the walls helping to reduce drafts, improve indoor air quality and providing a more energy efficient home. The breathable structure of Tyvek® HomeWrap® allows moisture vapour to escape helping to promote drying within the wall which can aid in preventing mould, mildew and water damage.'),
    ('zn-mapeguard-board-1-2-4-8', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0331/0321/6685/files/4_mapeguard-1_ca3a61ad6d5b4089bb77fba8fe2a70d6_800x.jpg?v=1758742881', 'Mapeguard Board is a multipurpose, premium-performance, lightweight, rigid, waterproof backer-board panel that is made with a high-density, extruded polystyrene core. This backer board features a high-strength, waterproof membrane and facer on both sides to provide water and vapor protection. Mapeguard Board is for use under ceramic tile and stone installations for both residential and commercial interior applications. The uniquely engineered, multi-layered design is available in thicknesses from 1/4" to 2" (6 mm to 5 cm) for use on walls, floors, ceilings and countertops, as well as for fabrication of room partitions, benches, seats and furnishing elements, delivering a dimensionally stable substrate. Attaches to wood or metal framing Lifetime system warranty when combined with other qualifying products Coated with a superior-performing waterproof membrane and facer Low perm rating; approved for use in steam rooms and showers Tab washers not required on floors and walls Easy to cut with a standard utility knife without mess Lightweight and easy to handle Available in multiple thicknesses.'),
    ('zn-mapeguard-board-1-2-3-5', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0331/0321/6685/files/4_mapeguard-1_ca3a61ad6d5b4089bb77fba8fe2a70d6_800x.jpg?v=1758742881', 'Mapeguard Board is a multipurpose, premium-performance, lightweight, rigid, waterproof backer-board panel that is made with a high-density, extruded polystyrene core. This backer board features a high-strength, waterproof membrane and facer on both sides to provide water and vapor protection. Mapeguard Board is for use under ceramic tile and stone installations for both residential and commercial interior applications. The uniquely engineered, multi-layered design is available in thicknesses from 1/4" to 2" (6 mm to 5 cm) for use on walls, floors, ceilings and countertops, as well as for fabrication of room partitions, benches, seats and furnishing elements, delivering a dimensionally stable substrate. Attaches to wood or metal framing Lifetime system warranty when combined with other qualifying products Coated with a superior-performing waterproof membrane and facer Low perm rating; approved for use in steam rooms and showers Tab washers not required on floors and walls Easy to cut with a standard utility knife without mess Lightweight and easy to handle Available in multiple thicknesses.'),
    ('zn-xps-foam-shower-curb-4-4-1-2-x60', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0331/0321/6685/files/0002655_xps-foam-shower-curb-4-x-4in-x-60in_800x.jpg?v=1758740233', 'Tooltech® Xpert XPS Foam Niches are a perfect way to create extra space for a multitude of shower products or individual decorating ideas. Their prefabricated aesthetically pleasing designs come in a multitude of styles/sizes and are quick and easy to install. Tooltech® Xpert Shower Curb is made out of XPS Foam. Notched for easy insulation of shower stall curb. Part of the XPS Foam Shower Niche System. It’s perfect for eas, faster and water tight installation. Size: 4 x 4½ x 60”. Color: Blue. 1/2” Notched Ends with Plug. Waterproof. Material: XPS Foam Board.'),
    ('zn-novawrap-aspire-house-wrap-3x100-300sqft', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0331/0321/6685/files/51207306_L_800x.jpg?v=1758740183', 'NovaWrap Aspire is a non-woven building wrap, non perforated polypropylene fabric that provides the ideal ratio of water resistance vs moisture vapor transmission to the outside. Thus, it let''s the structure breathe while preventing damage due to water infiltration. NovaWrap Aspire does not absorb or retain water. Compatible with many material like plywood, OSB, Gypsum composite, rigid foam etc. Exceed competition in strength, water intrusion, moisture, vapor transmission and reduce air infiltration For up to 6 story buildings and under for both commercial and residential buildings Improved air quality by reducing water intrusion which eliminates molds and mildew.'),
    ('zn-100pc-stainless-steel-washers-for-xps-foam-board', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0331/0321/6685/files/0002649_5pc-xps-foam-tile-backer-board-12in-3ft-a-5ft_36a6d6e1-2601-4732-adc2-9437da4779eb_800x.jpg?v=1758735856', 'Tooltech® Xpert Stainless Steel Screws and Washers are used to quickly fasten Tooltech® Xpert XPS Tile Foam Backer Boards to the supporting studs. Washers should be recessed in the board slightly and covered with Single Sided Butyl Tape for a watertight installation. FEATURES. Spacing for installation at 16 in. horizontally and 12 in. vertically. Material: Stainless Steel. Size: 32mm Diameter. Quantity: 100 pieces.'),
    ('zn-100pc-stainless-steel-screws-for-xps-foam-board-8x40mm', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0331/0321/6685/files/0002649_5pc-xps-foam-tile-backer-board-12in-3ft-a-5ft_6e708a1e-d687-4f1c-9b68-ce9dff24aad3_800x.jpg?v=1758735764', 'Tooltech® Xpert Stainless Steel Screws and Washers are used to quickly fasten Tooltech® Xpert XPS Tile Foam Backer Boards to the supporting studs. FEATURES. Material: Stainless Steel. Flat Head Phillips Screws #8 x 40mm. Quantity: 100 pieces.'),
