    ('zn-columbus-30-white', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0331/0321/6685/files/Capture_ea45c618-284b-42a0-8163-49cd44c9e210_800x.png?v=1753467752', 'Vesta’s premium Columbus 30" white stainless steel under-cabinet range hood features mechanical buttons that enable you to select between 3 fan speeds, with the highest speed providing a powerful airflow of 750 CFM. The centrally-positioned front light provides ample brightness, effectively illuminating your cooking area. The noise level always remains below 65 decibels, even at the highest fan speed. The oil cups and trays facilitate simplified, hassle-free cleaning and maintenance. The top vent options include a round-shaped connector (6" diameter) and a rectangular connector (3.5" × 10"). The back vent connector is rectangular in shape (3.5"×10"). 750 CFM 90 Watts (W×D×H) Hood Dimensions: 29.75" × 22" × 8" Sell in store only-Call for available stock.'),
    ('zn-dallas-30-white', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0331/0321/6685/files/Capture_2be74a42-292c-45fe-9ec4-e72ed9b88fb3_800x.png?v=1753467328', 'Vesta''s Dallas 30-inch white under-cabinet range hood is a durable companion for your kitchen. Featuring a pair of strong motors, mechanical buttons, two round filters, and an incandescent light, this unit will take your cooking experience to a new level. This range hood exhausts air at a maximum level of 750 CFM You can switch between 3 fan speeds using the mechanical buttons The oil cups catch any excess oil drops to save you time and effort The glass canopy helps improve suction performance by 15% An incandescent light provides a brighter cooking area The range hood''s stainless steel body is easy to clean with a wet cloth 750 CFM 70 Watts (W×D×H) Hood Dimensions: 29.7" × 21" × 4.84" Sell in store only-Call for available stock.'),
    ('zn-acadia-30-silver', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0331/0321/6685/files/Capture_63baa473-3511-4bea-b453-4b8786d3f348_800x.png?v=1753467069', 'Vesta''s Acadia 30" stainless steel under-cabinet range hood is a durable companion for your kitchen. Featuring twin strong motors, a touchscreen control panel, two baffle filters, a glass canopy, and two LED lights, this unit will elevate your cooking experience to new heights. ✅ Powerful Ventilation – Exhausts air at a maximum 900 CFM, efficiently removing smoke, grease, and odors. ✅ Customizable Airflow – Easily switch between 16 fan speeds using the responsive touchscreen control panel. ✅ Versatile Operation – Effortlessly control the range hoods using the touchscreen, voice controls, or gesture controls. ✅ Powerful Ventilation Motors – Two advanced DC motor delivers strong ventilation while operating more quietly than standard range hoods. ✅ Easy-to-Clean Baffle Filters – Detachable and dishwasher-friendly stainless steel filters ensure hassle-free maintenance. ✅ Simple Installation – Equipped with a 6-inch round top vent connector, compatible with most standard ducting systems. ✅ Energy-Efficient LED Lighting – Two long-lasting LED lights provide bright, energy-saving illumination for your cooking space. ✅ Durable & Easy-to-Maintain Design – The sleek stainless steel body is resistant to stains and easily wipes clean with a damp cloth. 1000 CFM 80 Watts (W×D×H) Hood Dimensions: 29.5" × 22.1" × 7.2" Sell in store only-Call for available stock.'),
    ('zn-dover-30-black', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0331/0321/6685/files/Capture_74d5a4ed-2074-4631-b748-b57925fa0c5c_800x.png?v=1753466604', 'UNIQUE DESIGN: This new range hood utilizes a 90° automatic open baffle plate for advanced side draft filtration, reducing the dispersion of cooking fumes and odors while enhancing airflow by quickly filtering up to 6 square feet of space. POWERFUL OPERATION: Introducing the industry''s inaugural side draft range hood, featuring our most advanced turbo motor. This innovation delivers superior filtration while reducing noise levels to just 42dB, enabling you to listen to music or enjoy conversations with friends and family without interruption. DESIGNED FOR SAFETY: The open-fume baffle plate effectively prevents smoke from spreading and protects you against its harm. USER-FRIENDLY LCD SCREEN & AUTO DELAY SHUTOFF: This range hood offers convenient operation. With hand gesture recognition, you can effortlessly switch between the three fan speeds by waving your hand to the right to increase the speed or to the left to shut down the hood (when facing the range hood). Additionally, the unit comes equipped with an auto-delay shutoff function, ideal for situations where you need to attend to other tasks, such as caring for a baby or playing with pets after cooking. Simply set it up and leave the kitchen without worry. 6-INCH TOP ROUND VENT: The unit''s 6-inch-diameter top vent is designed to be compatibility with most kitchens. LONG-TERM WARRANTY: Gain peace of mind with our one-year unlimited warranty, backed by an extended lifetime motor warranty, ensuring long-term reliability and customer satisfaction. For questions or technical support, call us at 905-886-5858 during business hours. 1000 CFM 420 Watts (W×D×H) Hood Dimensions: 29.75" × 16.75" × 19.69" Sell in store only-Call for available stock.'),
    ('zn-alexandria-30-metallic-black', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0331/0321/6685/files/Capture_c5d82e19-e663-4324-bb33-dc3fdc39dc14_800x.png?v=1753466183', 'Vesta''s Alexandria 30" metallic black stainless steel under-cabinet range hood is a durable companion for your kitchen. Featuring a pair of strong motors, a touchscreen panel, three baffle filters, and a long LED bar, this unit will elevate your cooking experience to new heights. This unit exhausts air at a 860cfm level maximum You can switch between 6 fan speeds using the touchscreen The baffle filters are detachable and dishwasher-friendly 6" round or 3.25"×10" rectangular vent connections on top The LED light bar provides a brighter cooking area Seamless stainless steel body is easy to clean with a wet cloth 860 CFM 220 Watts (W×D×H) Hood Dimension: 29.75" × 22" × 6.9" Sell in store only-Call for available stock.'),
    ('zn-columbus-30-silver', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0331/0321/6685/files/Capture_1c7cbd12-8edc-4ef5-afca-08b8384b7711_800x.png?v=1753454320', 'Vesta''s premium Columbus 30" Stainless Steel Under-Cabinet Range Hood is equipped with mechanical buttons, enabling you to select between three fan speeds, with the highest speed providing a powerful airflow of 750 CFM. The centrally-positioned front light provides ample brightness, effectively illuminating your cooking area. The noise level always remains below 65 decibels, even at the highest fan speed. The oil cups and trays facilitate simplified, hassle-free cleaning and maintenance. The top vent options include a round-shaped connector (6" diameter) and a rectangular connector (3.5" × 10"). The back vent connector is rectangular in shape (3.5" × 10"). 750 CFM 90 Watts (W×D×H) Hood Dimension: 29.75" × 22" × 8" Sell in store only-Call for available stock.'),
    ('zn-copenhagen-30-rose-gold', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0331/0321/6685/files/Capture_3fcee9d9-bc86-43bd-8aff-cd4aab377d43_800x.png?v=1753287041', 'Vesta''s Copenhagen 30-inch rose gold stainless steel wall-mounted range hood is a durable companion for your kitchen. Featuring an ultra strong motor, a touchscreen panel, two baffle filters, and an LED light, this unit will elevate your cooking experience to new heights. Powerful Ventilation: This range hood exhausts air at an impressive 800 CFM to keep your kitchen fresh and odor-free. Customizable Airflow: Choose between 6 fan speeds using the intuitive touchscreen for precise ventilation. Hassle-Free Maintenance: Removable, dishwasher-safe baffle filters make cleaning quick and easy. Universal Compatibility: Equipped with a 6-inch diameter round top vent connector for seamless installation. Energy-Efficient Lighting: The unit''s long-lasting LED light provides bright and eco-friendly illumination for your cooking area. Sleek & Easy-to-Clean: The stainless steel body is sleek and stylish, and easy to clean with a wet cloth. 800 CFM 200 Watts (W×D×H) Hood Dimension: 29.75" × 22.13" × (22.75" - 43") Chimney Dimensions: 12" × 11.13" × (20.25" - 40.5") Sell in store only-Call for available stock.'),
    ('zn-hamburg-30-silver', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0331/0321/6685/files/Capture_1f871152-d8aa-4057-85d9-67105f6f9196_800x.png?v=1753286520', 'Vesta''s Hamburg 30-inch stainless steel wall-mounted range hood is a durable and reliable companion for your kitchen. Featuring an ultra strong DC motor, a touchscreen panel, two baffle filters, a stainless steel canopy, and two LED lights, this range hood will elevate your cooking experience to new heights. Here''s what makes it stand out: Powerful Ventilation – Exhausts air at a maximum 1000 CFM, efficiently removing smoke, grease, and odors. Customizable Airflow – Easily switch between 16 fan speeds using the responsive touchscreen control panel. Versatile Operation – Enjoy effortless control with voice, gesture, or touchscreen commands. Whisper-Quiet Performance – The advanced DC motor delivers strong ventilation while operating more quietly than standard range hoods. Easy-to-Clean Baffle Filters – Detachable and dishwasher-friendly stainless steel filters ensure hassle-free maintenance. Simple Installation – Equipped with a 6-inch round top vent connector, compatible with most standard ducting systems. Energy-Efficient LED Lighting – Two long-lasting LED lights provide bright, energy-saving illumination for your cooking space. Durable & Easy-to-Maintain Design – The sleek stainless steel body is resistant to stains and easily wipes clean with a damp cloth. 1000 CFM 80 Watts (W×D×H) Hood Dimension: 29.5" × 22" × (23.2" - 46.2") Chimney Dimensions: 13.2" × 12" × (20" - 43") Sell in store only-Call for available stock.'),
    ('zn-brussels-30-metallic-black', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0331/0321/6685/files/Capture_66698666-3e38-4955-ad10-4d951373592e_800x.png?v=1753285733', 'Strong Suction, High Efficiency: Engineered with an advanced turbo motor design, this premium black stainless steel range hood delivers exceptional 800 CFM suction power. Its durable, anti-corrosive construction ensures long-lasting performance while efficiently removing smoke and odors. Powerful & Quiet: Equipped with an upgraded extra-long filter and an ultra-powerful motor, this range hood offers 800 CFM suction with ease. Even at maximum speed, it operates at a noise level below 65 dB, allowing you to enjoy your favorite music or show while cooking! Two-Way Control: Experience the latest innovation with gesture controls—just wave your palm to command the unit, even with wet hands! Prefer a touch interface? The responsive touchscreen lets you effortlessly adjust between 6 fan speeds, toggle the lights, or power the unit on and off. Easy to Clean: This unit efficiently separates and traps grease from the air while in use, keeping your kitchen fresh. The removable, dishwasher-safe baffle filters simplify maintenance, and the sleek exterior cleans effortlessly with a damp cloth and warm water. Enhanced LED Lighting: Positioned on the bottom of the unit, the new LED light brightly illuminates your cooking area for improved visibility and safety. With two adjustable brightness levels, you can customize the lighting to suit your needs perfectly. Convenient Remote Control: Effortlessly operate your range hood from a distance with the handheld remote. Its intuitive buttons and touch controls let you easily adjust fan speeds, control lighting, and activate delayed power on/off for added convenience. Lifetime Motor Warranty: Enjoy peace of mind with a one-year limited parts warranty and a lifetime motor warranty. If you have any questions or need assistance, our friendly customer service team is always here to help. 800 CFM 220 Watts (W×D×H) Hood Dimension: 29.75" × 22.13" × (26.9" - 42.4") Chimney Dimensions: 12" × 11.13" × (15.5" - 31") Sell in store only-Call for available stock.'),
