    ('zn-1-3-4-x9-1-2-face-mount-hanger', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0331/0321/6685/files/1_304aef8b-f8ad-44cb-ac10-4550d9056947_800x.png?v=1751997245', 'Global leader in structural construction products since 1956 Products designed and tested for strength and easy installation Diverse product line trusted by Pros and DIYers alike Can be installed after the beam is secured in place Cannot be modified HUS-series hangers are tested, load rated and code compliant Seat width: 1-13/16-in Actual joist size: 1-3/4-in x 11-1/4-in to 11-7/8-in Made from 16-Gauge steel Galvanized (G90) for extra corrosion resistance Install with 0.162 in. x 3-1/2 in. nails (16DHDG).'),
